#X text 20 670 jog edge (CC 33) browses songs. SHIFT+jog (CC 41) moves in the timeline. SHIFT+SYNC sends its own note (96) - from the rekordbox DDJ-200 mapping;
#X obj 980 300 r ddj-calibrate;
#X obj 1180 300 loadbang;
#X obj 1180 325 delay 1000;
#X msg 980 360 240 \, 0 \, 64 \, 5 \, 0 \, 0 \, 2 \, 10 \, 0 \, 3 \, 1 \, 247;
#X obj 980 385 midiout;
#X text 980 410 calibrate: SHIFT+MASTER CUE \, the CALIBRATE button \, or 1 s after opening. the DDJ-200 answers this SysEx (from the Mixxx mapping) by re-sending every knob and fader position;
